{"articleNo":"3160","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=3160&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] 해양영토대장정 참가 신청 접수","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.06.29","hit":"27616","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->\n<p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">안녕하세요</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">제</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">28</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">대 젊은그대 총학생회입니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; </p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">시원하고 푸른 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2011</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">년 여름을 맞아 총학생회에서</span></p>\n<p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">‘2011 </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">젊은그대 해양영토대장정</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">’</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">을 준비하였습니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; </p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">기존의 국토순례를 신선하게 변화시켜 해안선을 따라 걷고</span></p>\n<p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">배를 타고 먼 바다 섬마을 방문해 봉사활동 시간도 가지는</span></p>\n<p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">바다 여행으로 기획해 준비하고 있습니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; </p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">현재</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">매일신문</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, KBS</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">방송국</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">경북경영자총협회 등의 기관을 섭외하였고</span></p>\n<p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">국토해양부와 환경부 그리고 구미시청과 통영시청 등 정부기관과 지자체의</span></p>\n<p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">협력도 긍정적으로 얻어낼 것으로 기대하고 있습니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; </p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">평생에 한번 뿐인 여름 여행에 더하여 취업과 진학시 필요한</span></p>\n<p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">다양한 스펙 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">완주증</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">수료증</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">봉사활동 점수 등</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">도 함께 준비하세요</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; </p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">학우 여러분의 귀중한 포트폴리오 자원이자 능동적인 도전의 기회가 될</span></p>\n<p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">이번 해양영토대장정에 많은 관심과 참여를 부탁드립니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; </p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">◎</span></p>\n<p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span styl