; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) sensation2011@nate.com</span></p>\n<p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; </p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">접수기간</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 6</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">월</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">22</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">일 수요일부터 선착순 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">80</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">명</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">!! </span></p>\n<p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; </p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">참가 신청하실 때 이름</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">학번</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">소속 학과</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">연락처</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">이상 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">4</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">가지를 말씀해주시면 됩니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
